  "title": "Ziyarat of Halimah al-Sa'diyyah (r.a.), Foster Mother of the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.)",
  "data": "At the grave of Halimah al-Sa'diyyah in al-Baqi, recite:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا اُمَّ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA UMMA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O mother of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا اُمَّ صَفِيِّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA UMMA SAFIYYILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O mother of the chosen one of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا اُمَّ حَبِيْبِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA UMMA HABEEBILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O mother of the beloved of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا اُمَّ الْمُصْطَفٰى\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA UMMAL MUSTAFAA\nPeace be upon you, O mother of the Chosen One.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا مُرْضِعَةَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA MURDI'ATA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O nurse of the Messenger of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا حَلِيْمَةُ السَّعْدِيَّةُ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKI YAA HALEEMATUS SA'DIYYAH\nPeace be upon you, O Halimah al-Sa'diyyah.\nفَرَضِيَ اللّٰهُ تَعَالٰى عَنْكِ وَاَرْضَاكِ وَجَعَلَ الْجَنَّةَ مَنْزِلَكِ وَمَاْوَاكِ\nFARADIYALLAAHU TA'AALAA A'NKI WA ARDAAKI WA JA'ALAL JANNATA MANZILAKI WA MA'WAAK\nMay Allah, the Exalted, be pleased with you and please you, and make Paradise your dwelling and your shelter;\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATULLAAHI WA BARAKAATUH\nand the mercy of Allah and His blessings be upon you.",
  "merits": "Halimah, daughter of Abu Dhu'ayb, of the tribe of Banu Sa'd, nursed the Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) as an infant and brought him up among her people in the desert for his first years before returning him to his mother Aminah. He honoured her all his life. A grave in al-Baqi is attributed to her.\n\nThis ziyarat is given in the Shia manuals of Hajj, such as Sayyid Jawad Husayni Shahrudi's Adab al-Haramayn, without a narrated source."
}
